---
// src/components/features/estagio/obrigatorio/EstagioObrigatorioWidget.astro — Widget de Resumo das 300h de Estágio
---

<div class="cagp-card p-5 bg-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between h-full shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#0A0A0A] hover:shadow-[1.5px_1.5px_0_0_#0A0A0A] hover:translate-x-[1px] hover:translate-y-[1px] transition-all select-none">
  <div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3.5">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-lg border border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
          <i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill text-[#FF8811]" aria-hidden="true" />
        </span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-head font-bold text-sm uppercase text-[#0A0A0A] leading-tight m-0">
            Estágio Curricular (300h)
          </h3>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-[#57534E] font-mono">DCP 135 (180h) + DCP 136 (120h)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-head text-[11px] font-bold bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white border border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
        7º e 8ºP
      </span>
    </div>

    <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#292524] leading-relaxed mb-3.5">
      Componente obrigatório supervisionado pelo DCP em órgãos conveniados ou com dispensa prevista pelo Art. 41.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4 text-xs">
      <div class="p-2.5 bg-[#FBF8F3] border border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-lg text-center shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
        <div class="font-mono font-bold text-[#9E2424]">180h (12 cr)</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-[#57534E] uppercase font-head font-bold">DCP 135 • Estágio A</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-2.5 bg-[#FBF8F3] border border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-lg text-center shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
        <div class="font-mono font-bold text-[#9E2424]">120h (8 cr)</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-[#57534E] uppercase font-head font-bold">DCP 136 • Estágio B</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a
    href="#obrigatorio"
    class="min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2.5 bg-[#0A0A0A] hover:bg-[#9E2424] text-white rounded-xl font-head text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all no-underline border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[2.5px_2.5px_0_0_#0A0A0A] active:translate-x-[2px] active:translate-y-[2px] active:shadow-none"
  >
    <span>Ver Normas de Estágio</span>
    <i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true" />
  </a>
</div>
